  {t="C",q=7829,x=55.6,y=51.4,m=1425,text="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 20 Savage Owlbeasts. Return to him once the task is complete. Markhor mentioned that the Savage Owlbeasts occupy the wilds of the Hinterlands."},
